[DATA label=cah_c] body.continue_url = {{CAH_NESTED_URL}} {OBSERVED} -- the top-level and the nested continue_url are the SAME url, so the two paths are aliases rather than two different handoffs. Compared through a CAPTURE, not a path-on-the-right assertion: the MCP family scores a `body.x = body.y` RHS as a literal string, so that form is a guaranteed false red
[EVIDENCE] a client that reads response.checkout.continue_url uniformly across all three tools gets undefined from ALL THREE, not just two -- narrative synthesis of the four checks above (cross-label comparison, not independently scoreable as one predicate)

